{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"5796","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v580","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"山本和枝(やまもと☆かずえ)","creatorId":"vndb:s2266","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:168","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2266","name":"山本和枝(やまもと☆かずえ","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:12542","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"秋タカシ(太田顕喜)","creatorId":"vndb:s2205","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:3147","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2205","name":"秋タカシ(太田顕喜)","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:16416","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"まじか(まじか姐、まじかっち)","creatorId":"vndb:s6744","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:1480","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6744","name":"まじか(まじか姐、まじかっち)","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:19480","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"高橋 直樹","creatorId":"vndb:s2917","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2917","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2917","name":"高橋 直樹","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:12611","source":"vndb"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"ぴょんも","creatorId":"vndb:s3199","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3199","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3199","name":"ぴょんも","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:12612","source":"vndb"}],"other":[{"creditedName":"CANDY","creatorId":"vndb:s3200","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3200","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3200","name":"CANDY","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:12613","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c39651","characterName":"ライル・エインズワース","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c39651"},"originalCharacterName":"ライル・エインズワース","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hunters are already rare,and it is said that only one in every 100 hunters are born as males. Of the new recruits this year, only he and Justine are enrolled."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After losing his parents, he was raised by relatives. He and Monica are childhood friends that live next to each other."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He was living in the countryside when suddenly he was attacked by a monster. After fighting it off with Monica, he discovered his potential as a hunter."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His weapon is a sword and doesn't have a favorite subject."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c39651"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/3438e4326541e11a7136da2e0befec848cf63de9592fbe79748e334a7026f3a4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/066dba39dde1efe5a0f1dcbbd2550dc8d0eced576627c456957eb57470f5f7ec.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中國 卓郎","creatorId":"vndb:s1067","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1067","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1067","name":"中國 卓郎","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:5933","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c39652","characterName":"モニカ・オルブライト","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c39652"},"originalCharacterName":"モニカ・オルブライト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A childhood friend who lived next door to Ryle. Together they discovered her potential as a hunter. Ryle's quarrel buddy who is like a family to her. She is active, open-minded and usually kind, but her shortcoming is that she can be a bit quick to anger."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She grew up with her mother, but she passed away a few years ago due to an injury. Since then, she has been living alone, working various part-time jobs such as a maid and waitress. Although she acts normal, Ryle was her only source of comfort."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her specialty is white magic. She and Gilbert, who also teaches white magic, are father and daughter, but they are currently in a quarrel but it seems only on Monica sided."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c39652"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/dfe83fdd88d157994a02171120f7a1ac5519eecfc0c164c7a582904bf734a12a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c73ce1316d78416818a3ce3fe8da944f6256332d63962b5c72911e74b48b8177.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"咲 ゆたか","creatorId":"vndb:s1595","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1595","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1595","name":"坂田 有希","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:5935","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60591","characterName":"リサ・エアハート","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60591"},"originalCharacterName":"リサ・エアハート","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is an oddball who came to the school because she wanted to be able to use her unused powers to the fullest (fight monsters with all her might). She is friendly and has the special skill of becoming friends with everyone she meets. Her defining characteristic is that she always ends her sentences with \"ssu\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a tomboyish, energetic appearance. Although she isn't particularly well-proportioned, her vulnerability and healthy sexiness are what make her so appealing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her specialty is, of course, combat. With incredible strength that belies her small physique, she can effortlessly swing around huge axes and maces. But her greatest weapon may still be her fists."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60591"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f1/f181d4b888c31e7ac9fad3cf62a3e929bc194be30a5ea3c8c22b475453eb63df.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/eceb7d1294f8ae7359b375a195891c2bba2185e5eafa761b1eedcb7e01d39519.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"みる","creatorId":"vndb:s364","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s364","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s364","name":"壱智村 小真","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:5928","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60592","characterName":"フィリス・サイフォン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60592"},"originalCharacterName":"フィリス・サイフォン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She comes from a family that has boasted high magical powers for generations, and she herself has high magical powers. However, for some reason she feels that this is an annoyance, and so she specializes in alchemy, a subject that doesn't involve much magic."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is usually quiet and seems to be not only indifferent to the protagonist, but even avoids him. The truth behind this will likely become clear in the future."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her weapon is the bow."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60592"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/33/3354fd8f1695c3682294379ee9de2714bb8f5575f24505a327424f9b4819deee.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/66/66d9d50e30c316e2d78ee7fd0ce1d417d7e822b779c5b08e1c94c8f999315108.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岩城 由奈","creatorId":"vndb:s3063","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3063","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3063","name":"岩城 由奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:5936","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60593","characterName":"綾小路 瑞穂","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60593"},"originalCharacterName":"綾小路 瑞穂","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a successor to the Eastern art of Onmyodo, and comes to this school to avenge her parents. She helps progress though this adventure by transforming into small animals such as cats or mermaids, but naturally, this often means losing her clothes and the embarrassment that it causes. She is a cheerful girl, but because of the purpose of her visit, she has a somewhat gloomy air about her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her specialty is natural magic. Her weapon is the sword. Once you become proficient, you can use two swords at the same time."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60593"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/df5734f36ec686211f4929b476e5b85fcc3f0b5fbe483c2fcce3a996a637952d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5/f517b71276e9dc0f3c4c97f1fc39b3d2dcaf4cf8830acca1e6422615897515c3.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"深井 晴花","creatorId":"vndb:s518","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s518","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s518","name":"ももぞの薫","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:5929","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60594","characterName":"ジャスティン・クライトン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60594"},"originalCharacterName":"ジャスティン・クライトン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He enrolled at the same time as the protagonist. He is a rare male student for a Hunter. Naturally, he becomes the protagonist's roommate. They build a good friendship for a while, but sometimes he exudes a sexiness that is unusual for a man, which worries the protagonist that he may be walking down a dangerous path."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His specialty is black magic, and he can also use various projectiles such as throwing knives and darts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because Marion, the black magic professor, is always concerned about him, the protagonist sometimes becomes suspicious of their relationship."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60594"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c4/c492241aec624b98cec7b2d056bd326c2cd0b9687d978249f759f07ae6a13354.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/18/1800f5900e2c0025d9cc891f54f2f28c4ca7614d83258a28015110018d02a263.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"深井 晴花","creatorId":"vndb:s518","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s518","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s518","name":"ももぞの薫","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:5930","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60595","characterName":"ミリアム・シンクレア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60595"},"originalCharacterName":"ミリアム・シンクレア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though still in her 30s, she is an exceptionally talented woman who oversees the Magic Academy of Wozerburg. Although she is a kind-hearted school principal, she can also be strict at times."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A little over 10 years ago, when she was still a student, the previous president caused a certain incident that led to her becoming the sixth president. However, during that time she lost her husband, whom she had married while she was still a student, and her newborn child."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60595"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c8f32e91c1feb453ad8ed76746762a4b7d5b7d460aa14eba333799ef25ba8419.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5/f5c613bf11b3acbd713400c8f16f9220c6e5fbaabc10746f663c0de04c5bfb6f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"Yuki-Lin","creatorId":"vndb:s801","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s801","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s801","name":"茉雪 千鶴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:5931","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60596","characterName":"マリオン・ワインバーグ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60596"},"originalCharacterName":"マリオン・ワインバーグ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An expert in black magic with outstanding proportions. Despite her aggressive behavior, she is a woman with a very kind heart."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For some reason, she cares deeply about Justine, which sometimes causes the protagonist to misunderstand their relationship."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60596"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/00/001201e8d7c976d61dbeb532176b41f23c0dce31803ea0ae78a532898f06cb99.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e482292a35b9faa366c58180f026944e1bb6038b977256461e7869ae1fcc0b7a.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"夕城 粧子","creatorId":"vndb:s4220","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4220","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4220","name":"夕城 粧子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:5937","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60597","characterName":"ギルバート・マクベイン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60597"},"originalCharacterName":"ギルバート・マクベイン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's an expert in white magic, but Monica describes him as a delinquent middle-aged womanizer. From the outside, he appears to be humorous, frivolous guy, but there's no way a guy like that could be this popular at school. Although he is said to be a womanizer, there are no rumors of him having affairs with female students, and in that regard, he seems to be surprisingly well-trusted by those around him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60597"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5f/5f15430dc6ebc47c753ebf6a28249e3c4d78f1c72cb5b5622d24dfee839e928f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8eb2c55f024ec5f6501d2bc7cd38f5e19676d07c7f55096bb1b18de02221f22b.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"広野 大地","creatorId":"vndb:s37","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s37","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s37","name":"鈴木 貴征","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:5926","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60598","characterName":"アーウィン・オークウッド","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60598"},"originalCharacterName":"アーウィン・オークウッド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a gentle, good-natured young man who looks good in glasses. He is a model of earnestness and sincerity, and teaches nature magic at the academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although he is a contemporary of Miriam and Gilbert, his talent was discovered at a young age, making his actual age considerably younger than his colleagues. He is heartbroken over the incident that occurred due to former master."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60598"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b4d33f4593a86e3eb652c12bbdcf706b7c4a9a50070f5134c45bff0d35aa78bb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/66/668da414338fde3ef8cb0add559ac37344fdebbc9fe0d978804a8e5d993e693b.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"坂崎涼","creatorId":"vndb:s13095","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s13095","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s13095","name":"坂崎涼","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:5941","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60599","characterName":"ロレッタ・ストーン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60599"},"originalCharacterName":"ロレッタ・ストーン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a gentle, laid-back lady. For an alchemy expert, she is a bit scatterbrained, and is quick to break beakers and flasks while saying things like \"Oh my,my,my.\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60599"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/60530be9b8c0a57424a217a9b05a9ac966e0cb3ea05e5c32675c14d8eda05758.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/05/053535894e7e68bd5e0c9de49fea6c732a8f915e000bdc7184c9279c3aa6d01b.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山咲 ちはる","creatorId":"vndb:s10561","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10561","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10561","name":"山咲 ちはる","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:5938","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60600","characterName":"武田 龍道","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60600"},"originalCharacterName":"武田 龍道","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a cheerful man with a sporty personality. He is a nice guy whose teeth shine when he smiles. Although he loves sweat and guts, he laments his own misfortune in this environment that is essentially an all-girls school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At the time, two boys finally enroll in the school, and he is overjoyed, but is disappointed that they are far from the ideal type of characters that he envisioned. Then Lisa, a sporty athletic girl, arrives and is a lovable character who is enthusiastic about combat, and it is as if he has finally gotten what he always wanted."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60600"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/83/8399453a993093d46f1c1793eb9d0a316b07bfdb5bab9bdfc9886ef3e13da7a5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1a4c18690975f1d09a666dd6ccac32765badd41ca5697b5e79ed5f9449628e31.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"飯島 肇","creatorId":"vndb:s13094","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s13094","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s13094","name":"飯島 肇","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:5939","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60601","characterName":"ミラ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60601"},"originalCharacterName":"ミラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A homunculus created though alchemy. Perhaps her previous creator did not have enough power to sustain her, so she stopped growing and remained in the form of a young girl, turning her into a vampire."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Now, she is kept alive by Jair who regularly shares his blood with her, but she feels deeply indebted to him for this."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She possesses high magical powers that belie her young appearance, and also has the ability to transform into a black cat."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60601"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/24/240932a8b8769a847e0a2bd69404b44a5fce251bad2bf99d8bb5f912944756c0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/56d3f6ea32d030680e52770ea4ab855b78e5efe70c7a1acc39e4223235d81636.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"Yuki-Lin","creatorId":"vndb:s801","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s801","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s801","name":"茉雪 千鶴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:5932","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60602","characterName":"ジェイル・イーデン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60602"},"originalCharacterName":"ジェイル・イーデン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a physical wizard who wields a giant magic sword. An orphan who has never known his parents, and has studied swordsmanship and magic under a certain wizard since he was a child. He grew up with Milla and loves her like a younger sister and somehow wants to turn her, a homunculus, into a human."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60602"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ce/ce55ea9e595f99dc03e033d1bf4be3f4049937abbb98798a12ad8df175edde99.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7ff3c7a545a5165